## 1. MINITERMINAL COMPONENT

**File:** `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-internal/packages/hub-ui/src/lib/components/tasks/MiniTerminal.svelte`

**Props:**
```typescript
interface Props {
  sessionId: string;      // Session to subscribe to
  status: 'active' | 'paused' | 'completed' | 'failed';  // Controls cursor animation
  taskTitle?: string;     // Optional title for header
}
```

**Key Patterns:**
- **Terminal Line Aggregation:** Converts streaming messages into 100-line terminal buffer, displays last 8 lines
- **Tool Icons & Formatting:** Maps tool names to emojis (🔍 for search, 📄 for read, ✏️ for write, $ for bash, etc.)
- **Auto-Scroll with Manual Override:** Detects user scroll, disables auto-scroll when user scrolls up, re-enables at bottom
- **WebSocket Integration:** Subscribes to `TOPIC_SESSIONS_UPDATES`, filters for session ID, processes "aggregated" semantic events
- **Reconnection Handling:** Resets sequence tracking on WebSocket reconnection (disconnected → connecting → connected)

**Rendering Approach:**
- Header bar with Terminal icon, live status (pulsing orange dot when active)
- Scrollable content area (max-h[calc(100%-2.5rem)]) with font-mono text
- Line-by-line display with hover opacity transition
- Animated cursor (▌) on last line when running

**Message Conversion Logic:**
```
agent_message → "> truncated content" (120 char limit)
user_message → (skip, not shown in terminal)
agent_thought → "💭 thinking..."
tool_call → "🔧 tool: summary..." then "✓ tool done" when complete
```

