## 2. CHATPANEL COMPONENT

**File:** `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-internal/packages/hub-ui/src/lib/components/sessions/ChatPanel.svelte`

**Props:**
```typescript
interface Props {
  sessionId: string;
  messages: OptimisticAggregatedMessage[];  // With optimisticStatus & tempId
  createdAt: string;
  onSendMessage: (content: string) => void;
  canSendMessages?: boolean;
  onRetryMessage?: (tempId: string) => void;
  onDismissMessage?: (tempId: string) => void;
}
```

**Key Patterns:**
- **Smart Auto-Scroll:** Two threshold levels:
  - Short content (<100px scrollable): tight 5px threshold (snap only at exact bottom)
  - Long content: forgiving 100px threshold (more natural scrolling feel)
- **Jump Button:** Shows when user scrolls up AND content is streaming
  - Displays badge with unread count (99+ max)
  - Click re-enables auto-scroll and jumps to bottom
- **Optimistic Messaging:** Extended messages with `optimisticStatus` (sending/sent/failed) and `tempId`
  - Failed messages show Retry/Dismiss buttons
  - Sending state shows pulsing opacity animation
- **User Scrolling Detection:** Debounced scroll detection with 150ms timeout to avoid jitter
- **Empty Message Filtering:** Skips tool_call (has no content field) but keeps all text-based
- **Session Duration:** Calculated from `createdAt` as "Xm Ys" format

**Rendering:**
- Flex layout with messages container (absolute inset-0) and input area below
- Messages keyed by ID (critical for stable rendering)
- Jump button positioned absolute bottom-4 right-6
- ErrorBoundary wraps each message for resilience

